  "notes": "Prices are LIST prices from the help centre. Zero/Standard/Advanced are MONTHLY evaluation subscriptions (rebill until you pass or cancel; Qualified traders pay no subscription); Direct is a one-time fee with no evaluation. fee is the listed price (monthly for subscriptions) - see extra.monthly_fee. No activation fee on accounts bought after 2026-07-08 (previously $149 on Advanced). Main site alpha-futures.com Cloudflare-blocks this host (403 for browser, curl and web_fetch), so the homepage, checkout, about/legal and /return-policy/ pages could not be checked today; any homepage promo banner or code is therefore unknown (discount_code null). Affiliate links default to 10% off but no public code is posted on the help centre. min_trading_days: Zero is advertised as a one-day pass; Standard (2) and Advanced (3) are the minimum implied by their 50%/40% evaluation consistency rules, not a stated rule. first_payout_days = 5 winning days of $200+. Weekend holding banned = all sim trades must be closed by 4:20pm ET daily (overnight holding allowed only in live accounts). News: no restrictions on Evaluations or Advanced Qualified; Zero/Standard/Direct Qualified cannot execute orders 2 minutes either side of red-folder events. Crypto exposure is only via CME Micro Bitcoin/Ether futures (MBT/MET), counted as full minis. Max withdrawal per request: Advanced $15K; Zero $1K-$2.5K; Standard $3K-$5K; Direct $1K-$3K. Payout processing time not published. Founded/HQ not found on reachable own-site pages (help centre names the operator 'Alpha Futures Limited' and says the Alpha Prime trading floor is in London; Trustpilot profile lists United States) - left null. Leverage n/a (contract limits per account instead). CAUTION: Trustpilot (https://www.trustpilot.com/review/alpha-futures.com, checked 2026-10-31) shows 4.3 from 6,242 reviews (85% 5-star, 10% 1-star, large invited-review base), but the most recent reviews (Oct 22-30, 2026) include a cluster of complaints from holders of the discontinued 'Premium' accounts saying approved payouts have been unpaid for months (one says 8 months) and that a promised end-of-October 2026 payment date was missed; others report approved payouts delayed about 10 days. Other recent reviews report payouts received, some after delays. Alpha Futures' payout policy page states 'follow the rules and you will be paid out'.",
